  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Enablement Mac</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rkande landsbygdskommu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fattiga samh&#xe4;llen p&#xe5; den makedonska landsbygden ska med CAD:s st&#xf6;d genomf&#xf6;ra projekt f&#xf6;r att l&#xf6;sa sina mest angel&#xe4;gna problem. Projektet st&#xe4;rker initiativf&#xf6;rm&#xe5;gan hos inv&#xe5;narna och deras m&#xf6;jligheter att planera och genomf&#xf6;ra projekt p&#xe5; egen hand.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poor communities in rural Macedonia will plan and carry out project to solve their most immediate problems, assisted by CAD. The project supports local initiative and strengthens the communities ability to plan and implement projects independently.</narrative>
  </description>
